# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Everything in this repo is already stored LF-only (git ls-files --eol shows
# i/lf across the board), but a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# the working copy to CRLF on checkout. Nothing about the commits changes — but
# PHPCS reads the working copy, so Generic.Files.LineEndings.InvalidEOLChar
# fires on every PHP file locally while CI, on Linux, sees none of it. A lint
# error that only exists on half the machines is worse than no lint error.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Treat font binaries as binary so autocrlf never rewrites them.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
